{"suttaId":"tha-ap483","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1841,1867],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap483:0.3":"Paṃsukūlasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap483:1.1":"“Tisso nāmāsi bhagavā, sayambhū aggapuggalo;","tha-ap483:1.3":"Paṃsukūlaṃ ṭhapetvāna, vihāraṃ pāvisī jino.","tha-ap483:2.1":"“Vinataṃ [sajjitaṃ (syā.), tiyantaṃ (pī.)] dhanumādāya, bhakkhatthāya cariṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap483:2.3":"Maṇḍalaggaṃ gahetvāna, kānanaṃ pāvisiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap483:3.1":"“Tatthaddasaṃ paṃsukūlaṃ, dumagge laggitaṃ tadā;","tha-ap483:3.3":"Cāpaṃ tattheva nikkhippa, sire katvāna añjaliṃ.","tha-ap483:4.1":"“Pasannacitto sumano, vipulāya ca pītiyā;","tha-ap483:4.3":"Buddhaseṭṭhaṃ saritvāna, paṃsukūlaṃ avandahaṃ.","tha-ap483:5.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, paṃsukūlamavandahaṃ;","tha-ap483:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, vandanāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap483:6.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap483:6.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap483:7.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","tha-ap483:7.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap483:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap483:8.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap483:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā paṃsukūlasaññako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap483:10.1":"Paṃsukūlasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
